e opportunities) Job Details: Location : F&M Campus - Lancaster, PA Classification : Full-time, Non-Exempt Schedule : 40 hours, 2nd-shift. 4:00 PM to 12:30 AM Reports to : Custodian Manager Department : Custodial Services Approved Hourly Rate : $15.00 + $1.50 shift differential Job Description: The Custodian provides cleaning services and trash removal throughout campus locations that consistently meet standards of cleanliness determined by Quality Assurance inspections. Essential Functions: Follow a routine, daily cleaning schedule for residential, academic and athletic campus facilities.  Daily duties include restroom, office, hallway/common area, classrooms and athletic space cleaning.  Routine cleaning methods include (but not limited to) operating manual and power tools/equipment including dust mops, wet mops, buckets, wringers, deck brushes, scrub brushes, vacuums, wet vacuums, chemical dispensers, hoses, foam dispensers, and microfiber cloths.   Consistently meet standards of cleanliness determined by Quality Assurance inspections. Provide trash removal for all campus facilities. Provide emergency/unscheduled support to campus due to increased campus program or staff shortage. Maintain and secure an inventory of supplies for assigned areas.  Report maintenance and safety issues to Supervisor or Facilities & Operations to ensure all aspects of assigned areas are functioning properly and safely. Maintain and secure an inventory of supplies for assigned areas. All other duties as assigned. Requirements: Minimum Qualifications: High School Diploma, GED, or equivalent combination of experience and training. At least one year of relevant general custodial experience. Ability to follow written and verbal instructions. Proficiency in Google Suite Products (Docs, Gmail, Sheets, Slides, Drive). Evidence of a commitment to community & belonging. Successful interview. Successful completion of a Physical examination. Successful completion of background checks. Additional 